    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Inspect your own app and identify two or thre accessibility issues using the POUR framework.\r\n\r\n2. Use the accessibility prompts in the [Prompt Playbook](https://studio.code.org/docs/ide/prompting-playbook/classes/accessibility-prompts) to prompt AI to revise your app by applying at least one or two accessibility improvements.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Don't have an app to inspect?**\r\n\r\nPrompt AI to create a simple page with a prompt like this:\r\n\r\n> Create the HTML and CSS for a simple one-page website that includes a few problems that violate POUR principles that a student could identify and improve, such as vague button text, page structure with issues, or unclear navigation.\r\n",
